  "amendment_text": "",
  "revision_reason": "◇ 제ㆍ개정 이유\nㅇ 선박소유자의 유류오염손해배상책임을 보증할 능력이 있다고 인정하는 외국의 보험사업ㆍ보증사업자인 선주상호보험조합 국제그룹(IG P&I Club)의 회원사 변경사항(기존 회원사의 합병, 신규사 설립, 명칭 변경 등)을 반영하기 위함\n◇ 주요내용\n선주상호보험조함 국제그룹(IG P&I Club) 회원사 변경사항 반영\n가. 신규회원사 신설(자회사 2개사)\n- American Club (Europe)\n- The London P&I Insurance Company (Europe) Limited\n나. 기존회원사 합병(합병전 2개사→ 합병후 1개사)\n- The North of England Protecting & Indemnity Association Limited, The Standard Club Ltd ⇒ NorthStandard Limited\n다. 기존회원사 명칭 변경 등(13개사)\n- American Steamship Owners Mutual Protection and IndemnityAssociation, Inc ⇒ American Steamship Owners Mutual Protection and Indemnity Association, Inc.\n- Gard P&I (Bermuda) Ltd. ⇒ Gard P.&I. (Bermuda) Limited\n- Assuranceforeningen Gard ⇒ Assuranceforeningen Gard (Gjensidig)\n- Assuranceforeningen Skuld ⇒ Assuranceforeningen Skuld (Gjensidig)\n- North of England P&I Designated Activity Company ⇒ NorthStandard EU DAC\n- The Standard Club UK Ltd. ⇒ The Standard Club UK Ltd\n- The Standard Club Ireland Designated Activity Company ⇒ The Standard Club Ireland DAC\n- The Standard Club Asia Ltd. ⇒ The Standard Club Asia Ltd\n- The Steamship Mutual Underwriting Association Ltd. ⇒ Steamship Mutual Underwriting Association Ltd.\n- The Steamship Mutual Underwriting Association (Europe) Limited ⇒ Steamship Mutual Underwriting Association (Europe) Limited\n- United Kingdom Mutual Steam Ship Assurance Association (Europe) Ltd. ⇒ United Kingdom Mutual Steam Ship Assurance Association Limited\n- United Kingdom Mutual Steam Ship Assurance Association (Bermuda) Limited ⇒ UK P&I (Bermuda)\n- UK P&I Club N.V.(UKNV) ⇒ UK P&I (UKNV)",
  "body": {
    "format": "articles",
    "article_count": 1,
    "articles": [
      {
        "article_no": "전문",
        "article_title": "",
        "chapter": "",
        "content": "1. 「유류오염손해배상보장법」 제15조제2항, 제48조제2항 및 같은 법 시행규칙 제2조제4호에 따라 선박소유자의 유류오염손해배상책임을 보증할 능력이 있다고 인정하는 외국의 보험사업ㆍ보증사업 또는 공제사업자① American Steamship Owners Mutual Protection and Indemnity Association, Inc.② American Club (Europe)③ Gard P.&I. (Bermuda) Limited④ Assuranceforeningen Gard (Gjensidig)⑤ Assuranceforeningen Skuld (Gjensidig)⑥ Skuld Mutual Protection and Indemnity Association (Bermuda) Ltd.⑦ The Britannia Steam Ship Insurance Association Limited⑧ The Britannia Steam Ship Insurance Association Europe⑨ The Japan Ship Owners' Mutual Protection & Indemnity Association⑩ The London Steam-Ship Owners' Mutual Insurance Association Limited⑪ The London P&I Insurance Company (Europe) Limited⑫ NorthStandard Limited⑬ NorthStandard EU DAC⑭ The Standard Club UK Ltd⑮ The Standard Club Ireland DAC<16> The Standard Club Asia Ltd<17> The Shipowners' Mutual Protection & Indemnity Association (Luxembourg)<18> The Steamship Mutual Underwriting Association (Bermuda) Limited<19> Steamship Mutual Underwriting Association Ltd.<20> Steamship Mutual Underwriting Association (Europe) Limited<21> Sveriges Angfartygs Assurans Forening(The Swedish Club)<22> United Kingdom Mutual Steam Ship Assurance Association Limited<23> UK P&I (Bermuda)<24> UK P&I (UKNV)<25> The West of England Ship Owners Mutual Insurance Association (Luxembourg)<26> Lloyd's Syndicate 2. 「유류오염손해배상보장법」 제15조제2항, 제48조제2항 및 같은 법 시행규칙 제2조제5호에 따라 선박소유자와 보장계약을 체결할 수 있는 법인① 「한국해운조합법」 제3조에 따른 \"한국해운조합\"② 「선주상호보험조합법」 제2조에 따른 \"한국선주상호보험조합(Korea P&I Club)\"",
